$ bmdctl program Nobody
! <red>error</>  no input "Nobody"
!        <dim>1 CAM1 Camera 1 · 2 CAM2 Camera 2 · 1000… · bmdctl inputs for all</>
[exit 1]

$ bmdctl program
! <red>error</>  missing <source>: program <source>
[exit 1]

$ bmdctl media clear 1
! <red>error</>  media clear empties a still slot
!        <dim>add --yes to do it</>
[exit 5]

$ bmdctl program Nobody
! error  no input "Nobody"
!        1 CAM1 Camera 1 · 2 CAM2 Camera 2 · 1000… · bmdctl inputs for all
[exit 1]

$ bmdctl --host 192.0.2.99 program 1
! <red>error</>  192.0.2.99 did not answer
!        <dim>no route to host · bmdctl doctor checks the network</>
[exit 2]

